'''Bushido Wildcats''' is a [[:category:Turkey|Turkish]] esports organization, which was created by [[İstanbul Wildcats]] through a partnership with former pro League of Legends player [[leagueoflegends:HolyPhoenix|HolyPhoenix]] and streamer [[:wikipedia:Jahrein|Jahrein]].

