'''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' is a [[:Category:CIS|CIS]] esports organization founded in 2023 that is a subsidiary of CYBERSHOKE. The organization has been based in [[:wikipedia:Belgrade|Belgrade]], [[:Category:Serbia|Serbia]] since 2024.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* July 12th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[flamie]], [[riskyb0b]], [[FenomeN]], [[fen2k]], [[sh1nejezzz]], and [[Flash_1]] as coach. <ref name="+cybershoke">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-182618011_523920|title=CYBERSHOKE ВРЫВАЕТСЯ В КИБЕРСПОРТ|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=CYBERSHOKE BREAKS INTO ESPORTS|date=2023-07-12|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 9th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[riskyb0b]]. <ref name="riskyb0b bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_143|title=riskyb0b уходит в запас CYBERSHOKE|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=riskyb0b goes to the bench in CYBERSHOKE|date=2023-10-09|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 16th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' part ways with [[Flash_1]] and [[sunlight]] while [[asph7xia]] takes over as interim coach. <ref name="-flash -sun">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_160|title=В свете последних неудовлетворительных результатов, мы приняли решение изменить нашу структуру и подход к игре|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=In light of recent poor results, we have decided to change our structure and approach to the game|date=2023-10-16|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 27th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' sign [[Re1GN]]. <ref name="+Re1GN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_213|title=Re1GN пятый игрок в CYBERSHOKE|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Re1GN is the fifth player in CYBERSHOKE|date=2023-10-27|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 27th - [[riskyb0b]] is acquired by [[Nemiga Gaming]]. <ref name="-riskyb0b">{{inside source}}</ref>

|content2=
* April 15th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[sh1nejezzz]] and [[Re1GN]] while parting ways with [[flamie]], [[fen2k]], and [[asph7xia]]. <ref name="apr24">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_573|title=flamie и fen2k покидают наш состав, а Re1GN и sh1nejezzz переведены в запас|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=flamie and fen2k are leaving our roster, and Re1GN and sh1nejezzz have been benched|date=2024-04-15|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 26th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' acquire [[kelieN]] from [[FORZE Youngsters]]. <ref name="+kelieN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_587|title=Капитан является одним из важнейших элементов в структуре любой команды|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The captain is one of the most important elements in the structure of any team|date=2024-04-26|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 27th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' acquire [[sstiNiX]] from [[FORZE Youngsters]]. <ref name="+sstiNiX">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_588|title=Третий игрок под цифрой 3|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The third player under the number 3|date=2024-04-27|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 28th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' acquire [[lov1kus]] from [[GUN5 Esports]]. <ref name="+lov1kus">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_595|title=Без Даниила состав не обойдётся|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The team can't do without Daniil|date=2024-04-28|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 29th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' acquire [[notineki]] and [[Nevar]] from [[Team Spirit Academy]] and [[Team Spirit Female]], respectively, the latter as coach. Additionally, they sign [[Rf]] as an analyst. <ref name="+notineki">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_598|title=Это финалочка!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=This is the final!|date=2024-04-29|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+Nevar">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_600|title=Вы просили — мы сделали|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=You asked — we delivered|date=2024-04-29|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+Rf">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_604|title=Последняя неделя была очень насыщенной|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The last week was very eventful|date=2024-04-29|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 22nd - [[sh1nejezzz]] is acquired by [[Betera Esports]]. <ref name="-sh1nejezzz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/betera_esports/status/1793235477375455322|title=Now it's official (not just rumors!)|date=2024-05-22|author=[[Betera Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 27th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[kelieN]]. <ref name="kelieN bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_858|title=kelieN выставлен на трансфер|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=kelieN is listed for transfer|date=2024-06-27|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 15th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' sign [[levantino]]. <ref name="+levantino">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_862|title=Levantino сыграет ближайшие турниры за наш тег|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Levantino will play the upcoming tournaments for our tag|date=2024-07-15|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 18th - [[Re1GN]] is acquired by [[HOTU]]. <ref name="-Re1GN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_5211|title=Re1GN присоединяется к нашему составу!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Re1GN joins our roster!|date=2024-07-18|author=[[HOTU]]}}</ref>
* September 1st - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' part ways with [[Rf]]. <ref name="-Rf">{{inside source}}</ref>
* October 14th - [[kelieN]] is acquired by [[Insilio]]. <ref name="-kelieN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-183767481_27022|title=Пришло время официально презентовать вам нового игрока|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=It's time to officially introduce you to a new player|date=2024-10-14|author=[[Insilio]]}}</ref>
* October 28th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' sign [[heis999]] as an analyst. <ref name="+heis999">{{inside source}}</ref>
* October 29th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[sstiNiX]] and acquire [[TruNiQ]] from [[Team Space]] on a 2-month loan. <ref name="+TruNiQ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_cybershoke/status/1851284154588991666|title=TruNiQ is replacing sstiNiX in our active lineup|date=2024-10-29|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 10th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' part ways with [[levantino]], [[TruNiQ]], and [[Nevar]]. <ref name="-3 jan25">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-221769466_1527|title=Пришло время прощаться|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=️It's time to say goodbye|date=2025-01-10|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* January 18th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' acquire [[bl1x1]] and [[glowiing]] from [[Aurora Young Blud]] and [[9Pandas]], respectively. <ref name="+bl1x1 +glowiing">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_cybershoke/status/1880572411961282890|title=glowiing is our new captain!|date=2025-01-18|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* March 12th - [[sstiNiX]] is acquired by [[AMKAL ESPORTS]]. <ref name="-sstiNiX">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_cybershoke/status/1899792500635640282|title=Today we say goodbye to sstiNiX as he joins @amkalesports|date=2025-03-12|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 5th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' sign [[brain]] as coach. <ref name="+brain">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_cybershoke/status/1908554528749760898|title=After a long wait, we can finally reveal our biggest secret|date=2025-04-05|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 26th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[lov1kus]] and acquire [[Forester]] from [[AMKAL ESPORTS]] as his replacement. <ref name="lov1kus bench">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team_cybershoke/3962|title=Пришло время прощаться — lov1kus покидает активный состав CYBERSHOKE|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=It's time to say goodbye — lov1kus is leaving CYBERSHOKE's active roster|date=2025-07-26|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+Forester">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team_cybershoke/3963|title=Трёхкратный участник мажора Forester присоединяется к CYBERSHOKE!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Three-time Major participant Forester joins CYBERSHOKE!|date=2025-07-26|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - [[heis999]] is acquired by [[Flame Sharks]]. <ref name="-heis999">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/flamesharks/457|title=На LAN в Казахстане прошли — можно и показать нового тренера Акул|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=We've completed the LAN in Kazakhstan - now we can show the new Sharks coach|date=2025-08-11|author=[[Flame Sharks]]}}</ref>
* September 9th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' part ways with [[Forester]] and reinstate [[lov1kus]] to the active lineup. <ref name="-Forester">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team_cybershoke/4205|title=Forester покидает наш состав|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Forester is leaving our roster|date=2025-09-09|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 26th - '''CYBERSHOKE Esports''' bench [[lov1kus]] and acquire [[alpha]] on loan from [[PARIVISION]] as his replacement. <ref name="alpha loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_cybershoke/status/1971559304022155537|title=alpha joins CYBERSHOKE on a loan deal!|date=2025-09-26|author='''CYBERSHOKE Esports'''}}</ref>

