* January 28th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' part ways with [[supa]], reinstate [[BAGEL]] to the starting lineup, and sign [[BiNoX]]. <ref name="-supa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ChickenCoopGG/status/1884370418204827798|title=Today, we announce that Supa will be parting ways with Chicken Coop|date=2025-01-28|author='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 1st - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' part ways with [[taggy]]. <ref name="-taggy">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/60906/chicken-coop-part-ways-with-taggy|title=Chicken Coop part ways with taggy|date=2025-05-01|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* May 7th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' part ways with [[BAGEL]]. <ref name="-bagel">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/61147/chicken-coop-cut-bagel|title=Chicken Coop cut BAGEL|date=2025-05-08|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
