* July 1st - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' bench [[Grave]] and acquire [[REKMEISTER]] on loan from [[Take Flyte]]. <ref name="rek1">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/63241/chicken-coop-swap-grave-for-rekmeister|date=2025-07-01|title=Chicken Coop swap Grave for REKMEISTER|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* August 2nd - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' acquire [[REKMEISTER]] from [[Take Flyte]]. <ref name="rekmeister">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ChickenCoopGG/status/1951853483533193410|title=We’re excited to announce that @REKMEISTER has officially joined Chicken Coop on a transfer from @TakeFlyteGG|date=2025-08-03|author='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
