* February 28th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' sign [[darkpsy]] as the team's coach. <ref name="darkpsy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ChickenCoopGG/status/2027619707172634959|date=2026-02-28|title=We’re excited to officially announce @darkpsyfps, the newest addition to Chicken Coop|author='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
* March 23rd - [[Panic]] leaves '''Chicken Coop Esports''' to join [[team mouse]]. <ref name="panic mouse">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/71971/team-mouse-close-ranks-with-panic|date=2026-03-23|title=team mouse close ranks with Panic|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* April 5th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' bench [[colin]] and sign [[mds (American player)|mds]]. <ref name="mds returns">{{cite web|url=https://chickencoop.gg/chicken-coop-roster-update/|title=Chicken Coop Roster Update|date=2026-04-05|author=[[Shooby]]|publisher='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 11th - [[colin]] leaves '''Chicken Coop Esports''' to join [[NuTorious]]. <ref name="colin nut">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/72736/nutorious-sign-colin-as-jolts-u-turns-on-joining-team|date=2026-04-11|title=NuTorious sign colin as Jolts U-Turns on joining team|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* September 18th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' part ways with [[mds (American player)|mds]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="-mds">{{cite web|url=https://chickencoop.gg/a-change-in-the-coop/|title=A Change in the Coop|date=2026-09-18|author=[[Shooby]]|publisher='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' part ways with [[REKMEISTER]] and sign [[Wolffe]] as his replacement while [[darkpsy]] is acquired by [[Copenhagen Wolves (American organization)|Copenhagen Wolves]]. <ref name="-rek +wolffe">{{cite web|url=https://chickencoop.gg/new-egg-empty-nest/|title=New egg, empty nest|date=2026-09-28|author=[[Shooby]]|publisher='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="-darkpsy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/CPHWolves/status/2104628675908153524|title=Counter-Strike. We are BACK|date=2026-09-28|author=[[Copenhagen Wolves (American organization)|Copenhagen Wolves]]}}</ref>
* October 2nd - '''Chicken Coop Esports''' acquire [[stesso]] from [[Esport Academy Copenhagen Extra]]. <ref name="+stesso">{{cite web|url=https://chickencoop.gg/a-kylling-joins-the-flock/|title=A Kylling joins the flock|date=2026-10-02|author=[[Shooby]]|publisher='''Chicken Coop Esports'''}}</ref>
